	"data": "Cyberdeck / Gargoyle Research — Concept Exploration\n\nA supplemental general-purpose computing module you wear, connect to from your phone or headset, for dev work and local network sensing.\n\nPart 1: cithoreal's \"Iron Man\" Project & Wearable Computing History\n\nProject Iron Man (OneNote archive, ~2021-2022)\n\ncithoreal designed a wearable modular hardware suit — literally called \"Project Iron Man\" — as the hardware layer for Star System (his XR operating system vision). The project was documented…",
